# AICL Example: Reverse String
# AX sub-language — compiles to real code.

Goal:
Reverse

Layer:
Core

Behavior Reverse
    Input: text
    Output: result
    Action:
        result = ""
        i = len(text) - 1
        while i >= 0:
            result = result + text[i]
            i = i - 1
        return result
